      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 782,
      "string_id": "esc_provodnik_start_15",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, why didn't you say so! Doctor is in Strelok's hiding place. If you are who you say you are, you probably know where it is.",
      "JA_current": "おい、それを先に言え！ Doctor は Strelok の隠し部屋にいる。お前が、自分で言った通りの男なら、そこがどこか分かるだろう。",
      "JA_new": "それを先に言ってくれよ！　ドクターはストレロクの隠し場所にいる。あんたが本物なら、場所は知ってるはずだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_provodnik_start",
          "phrase_id": "15",
